{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QZeVFiuq6neceuehtrMuVB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\texperiments:\n2\t  # === Completed ===\n3\t  - id: plan_000\n4\t    claim: 1\n5\t    description: \"Motivating experiment: 3D point-reaching, per-DOF vs scalar vs no uncertainty conditioning\"\n6\t    priority: P0\n7\t    gpu_budget_hours: 0.5\n8\t    deps: []\n9\t    registry_id: mvp-point-reaching\n10\t\n11\t  # === Primary Experiments (P0) — headline results ===\n12\t  - id: plan_001\n13\t    claim: 1\n14\t    description: \"ACR-VLA full pipeline on SmolVLA base: CGS + ACI/COC + CRM. Train CRM on LIBERO demos + synthetic augmentation. Evaluate on LIBERO (nominal preservation) + LIBERO-Plus L3-L5 (robustness gain).\"\n15\t    priority: P0\n16\t    gpu_budget_hours: 25\n17\t    deps: []\n18\t\n19\t  - id: plan_002\n20\t    claim: 1\n21\t    description: \"Ablation A3 — CRM without conformal features (observation-conditioned residual only, equivalent to A2C2-style generic residual). MAKE-OR-BREAK for Claim 1.\"\n22\t    priority: P0\n23\t    gpu_budget_hours: 8\n24\t    deps: [plan_001]\n25\t\n26\t  - id: plan_003\n27\t    claim: 1\n28\t    description: \"Ablation A4 — CRM with scalar uncertainty (Euclidean distance like ReconVLA) replacing 45D per-DOF features. Validates per-DOF > scalar.\"\n29\t    priority: P0\n30\t    gpu_budget_hours: 8\n31\t    deps: [plan_001]\n32\t\n33\t  - id: plan_004\n34\t    claim: 3\n35\t    description: \"ACR-VLA stacked on SRPO-finetuned VLA. Train new CRM on SRPO checkpoint + LIBERO demos. Evaluate on LIBERO-Plus. Primary impact argument: orthogonal to training-time optimization.\"\n36\t    priority: P0\n37\t    gpu_budget_hours: 18\n38\t    deps: [plan_001]\n39\t\n40\t  # === Important Experiments (P1) — ablations & analysis ===\n41\t  - id: plan_005\n42\t    claim: 2\n43\t    description: \"COC signal validation: (a) Spearman ρ between episode COC coverage fraction and task success, (b) ACI convergence plot, (c) ellipsoid volume comparison vs static calibration at matched coverage.\"\n44\t    priority: P1\n45\t    gpu_budget_hours: 15\n46\t    deps: [plan_001]\n47\t\n48\t  - id: plan_006\n49\t    claim: 2\n50\t    description: \"Ablation A1 — CRM without ACI (static CGS calibration, no online adaptation). Isolates ACI contribution.\"\n51\t    priority: P1\n52\t    gpu_budget_hours: 8\n53\t    deps: [plan_001]\n54\t\n55\t  - id: plan_007\n56\t    claim: 2\n57\t    description: \"Ablation A2 — ACI without CRM (CGS + COC + sample selection only, extending ReconVLA to multivariate). Isolates CRM contribution.\"\n58\t    priority: P1\n59\t    gpu_budget_hours: 8\n60\t    deps: [plan_001]\n61\t\n62\t  - id: plan_008\n63\t    claim: 1\n64\t    description: \"Per-perturbation-dimension breakdown: ACR-VLA gain across 7 LIBERO-Plus dimensions (camera, noise, robot-state, light, background, layout, language). Hypothesis: largest gains on camera/noise/robot-state.\"\n65\t    priority: P1\n66\t    gpu_budget_hours: 20\n67\t    deps: [plan_001]\n68\t\n69\t  # === Nice-to-have (P2) — bonus experiments ===\n70\t  - id: plan_009\n71\t    claim: 1\n72\t    description: \"Ablation A5 — CGS (joint Mahalanobis) vs per-DOF Bonferroni correction. Validates multivariate CP advantage.\"\n73\t    priority: P2\n74\t    gpu_budget_hours: 5\n75\t    deps: [plan_001]\n76\t\n77\t  - id: plan_010\n78\t    claim: 2\n79\t    description: \"Ablation A6 — COC signal vs episode-level task success for ACI update. Validates self-referential per-step signal.\"\n80\t    priority: P2\n81\t    gpu_budget_hours: 8\n82\t    deps: [plan_005]\n83\t\n84\t  - id: plan_011\n85\t    claim: 1\n86\t    description: \"Ablation A7 — CRM with DiU aleatoric features replacing CGS epistemic features. Also test combined epistemic+aleatoric 52D input. Validates epistemic-vs-aleatoric distinction.\"\n87\t    priority: P2\n88\t    gpu_budget_hours: 10\n89\t    deps: [plan_001]\n90\t\n91\t  - id: plan_012\n92\t    claim: 1\n93\t    description: \"Feature importance analysis: CRM gradient magnitude w.r.t. 45 uncertainty features, broken down by perturbation type. Validates dimension-selective correction mechanism.\"\n94\t    priority: P2\n95\t    gpu_budget_hours: 2\n96\t    deps: [plan_001, plan_008]\n97\t\n98\t  - id: plan_013\n99\t    claim: 1\n100\t    description: \"SnapFlow integration: K=10 × 1-step distilled generation. Test sample diversity preservation and inference speedup.\"\n101\t    priority: P2\n102\t    gpu_budget_hours: 5\n103\t    deps: [plan_001]\n104\t\n105\t# GPU Budget Summary\n106\t# P0: 25 + 8 + 8 + 18 = 59h H100 (+ 0.5h MVP done)\n107\t# P1: 15 + 8 + 8 + 20 = 51h H100\n108\t# P2: 5 + 8 + 10 + 2 + 5 = 30h H100\n109\t# Total: ~140h H100 (within 200h budget, ~60h buffer)\n110\t# On 1x RTX 4090: ~280-420h (2-3x slower), P0 alone ~5-7.5 days\n111\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018i52FenMRvkSHT69i2U2VC","session_id":"cb8be02c-35b7-47dd-bfab-cb2c629ce5a2","uuid":"4509ee07-3ca1-4e20-b75b-7e56aed39e17","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:14:43.774Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017TAdQEDqeZc8LPUU1eD9pT","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_8/projects/acr-vla-conformal-refinement/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — acr-vla-conformal-refinement\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: CoRL 2026 (abstract May 26, paper May 29) — 极紧，需 GPU 扩容至 ≥2x H100 才可行\\\\n- Backup: ICLR 2027 (expected deadline ~Sep-Oct 2026) — 充足时间\\\\n- 决策点: 若 3 天内 GPU 未扩容，放弃 CoRL，瞄 ICLR 2027\\\\n\\\\n## Core Insight\\\\nPer-DOF conformal statistics from multivariate CP on flow-matching VLA samples encode \\\\\\\"which action dimensions are uncertain and how they co-vary\\\\\\\" — fundamentally richer information than scalar uncertainty scores. A lightweight learned module conditioned on these structured features can perform dimension-selective action correction: aggressively correcting high-uncertainty DOFs while preserving confident predictions elsewhere.\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\\\\n1. **Per-DOF conformal features enable dimension-selective correction**: CGS 提取的 45D 结构化 uncertainty 特征（per-DOF std + conformal radius + ellipsoid volume）比标量 uncertainty（ReconVLA 的 Euclidean distance）和无 uncertainty conditioning 的残差策略（A2C2 类）提供显著更好的 action correction。\\\\n   - 验证: MVP (✅ done) + A3 ablation (make-or-break) + A4 ablation + feature importance analysis\\\\n   - Kill criterion: A3 (CRM without conformal features) 与 full ACR-VLA 差距 <2% → claim 不成立\\\\n\\\\n2. **ACI+COC 在分布偏移下维持 calibrated uncertainty，无需外部监督**: Chunk Overlap Consistency 提供自参考覆盖信号，ACI 在线更新 conformal threshold，在任意分布偏移下维持长期平均覆盖保证。\\\\n   - 验证: COC-success Spearman ρ + ACI 收敛 + ellipsoid volume vs static\\\\n   - Kill criterion: Spearman ρ < 0.3 AND ellipsoid volume 无 >10% 收窄 → fallback to episode-level ACI\\\\n\\\\n3. **ACR-VLA 与 training-time 方法正交互补**: 作为 inference-time 模块可叠加在 SRPO (82.1% LIBERO-Plus SOTA) 上进一步提升。\\\\n   - 验证: ACR-VLA + SRPO > SRPO alone\\\\n   - Kill criterion: stacking gain < 2% → claim 降级为\\\\\\\"complementary in principle\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n- **Problem**: Flow-matching VLAs 在标准 benchmark 上接近饱和(97-99%)，但 LIBERO-Plus 暴露了分布偏移下的灾难性鲁棒性缺口。现有方法分别解决检测(SAFE)、样本选择(ReconVLA)、训练时增强(RobustVLA/DiG-Flow/SRPO)，但没有方法在推理时利用结构化 uncertainty 信息主动校正动作。\\\\n- **Gap**: ReconVLA 用标量 Euclidean distance 做样本选择——丢弃跨维度协方差结构，且无法合成优于任何单个样本的动作。CP-in-the-Loop 通过 planning 闭环但非学习型参数化。UPS 用 CP 做策略门控但不将 conformal 特征作为校正网络输入。A2C2/PLD 学习残差但不利用 calibrated uncertainty features。\\\\n- **Our angle**: 第一个将多元 conformal 统计量作为学习型校正模块直接输入特征的方法。关键 insight 是 per-DOF conformal 特征编码\\\\\\\"哪些维度不确定+跨维度协方差\\\\\\\"，使 CRM 能做维度选择性校正。\\\\n- **Headline result template**: \\\\\\\"On LIBERO-Plus, ACR-VLA improves base VLA success by X%, and when stacked on SRPO (82.1%), achieves Y% — demonstrating that inference-time conformal correction provides orthogonal value beyond training-time optimization.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n1. **K=10 covariance 估计可靠性** (p/n=0.7): Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 是标准方案，MVP 已验证 K=10 estimated 仍有效（衰减 ~15pp 但仍显著）。若审稿人追问，可加 K=20 ablation。\\\\n2. **CRM 131K 参数表达力**: 故意轻量——防 overfitting + 保持推理速度。ablation 可测 dim 512 版本。\\\\n3. **Synthetic augmentation 覆盖不全** (layout/language 不可覆盖): Honest limitation。ACI 在线适应部分弥补。per-perturbation breakdown 是透明呈现。\\\\n4. **仿真 only**: CoRL 接受 sim-only，LIBERO-Plus 是 recognized benchmark。\\\\n5. **DiU 的 single-pass uncertainty 更高效**: DiU 捕获 aleatoric uncertainty（在分布内也高），CGS 捕获 epistemic uncertainty（分布偏移时升高）。A7 ablation 验证区分。\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3079, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012B2TkzmyCHsDUgBWLtvzBj","session_id":"cb8be02c-35b7-47dd-bfab-cb2c629ce5a2","uuid":"41d6231c-f9f0-4069-ac64-6c64c4de5ad8","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:14:43.708Z"}
