{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0181DKw33J967mJk2PmYar3w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W6oKNMAWvWTe7NGU6PmwKx","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_8/projects/acr-vla-conformal-refinement/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T023849/median/paper_framing.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3801,"cache_read_input_tokens":42928,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3801,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012B2TkzmyCHsDUgBWLtvzBj","session_id":"cb8be02c-35b7-47dd-bfab-cb2c629ce5a2","uuid":"5b4944f8-2318-444a-b929-0bb3a480d11b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W6oKNMAWvWTe7NGU6PmwKx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — acr-vla-conformal-refinement\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: CoRL 2026 (abstract May 26, paper May 29) — 极紧，需 GPU 扩容至 ≥2x H100 才可行\n5\t- Backup: ICLR 2027 (expected deadline ~Sep-Oct 2026) — 充足时间\n6\t- 决策点: 若 3 天内 GPU 未扩容，放弃 CoRL，瞄 ICLR 2027\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\tPer-DOF conformal statistics from multivariate CP on flow-matching VLA samples encode \"which action dimensions are uncertain and how they co-vary\" — fundamentally richer information than scalar uncertainty scores. A lightweight learned module conditioned on these structured features can perform dimension-selective action correction: aggressively correcting high-uncertainty DOFs while preserving confident predictions elsewhere.\n10\t\n11\t## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\n12\t1. **Per-DOF conformal features enable dimension-selective correction**: CGS 提取的 45D 结构化 uncertainty 特征（per-DOF std + conformal radius + ellipsoid volume）比标量 uncertainty（ReconVLA 的 Euclidean distance）和无 uncertainty conditioning 的残差策略（A2C2 类）提供显著更好的 action correction。\n13\t   - 验证: MVP (✅ done) + A3 ablation (make-or-break) + A4 ablation + feature importance analysis\n14\t   - Kill criterion: A3 (CRM without conformal features) 与 full ACR-VLA 差距 <2% → claim 不成立\n15\t\n16\t2. **ACI+COC 在分布偏移下维持 calibrated uncertainty，无需外部监督**: Chunk Overlap Consistency 提供自参考覆盖信号，ACI 在线更新 conformal threshold，在任意分布偏移下维持长期平均覆盖保证。\n17\t   - 验证: COC-success Spearman ρ + ACI 收敛 + ellipsoid volume vs static\n18\t   - Kill criterion: Spearman ρ < 0.3 AND ellipsoid volume 无 >10% 收窄 → fallback to episode-level ACI\n19\t\n20\t3. **ACR-VLA 与 training-time 方法正交互补**: 作为 inference-time 模块可叠加在 SRPO (82.1% LIBERO-Plus SOTA) 上进一步提升。\n21\t   - 验证: ACR-VLA + SRPO > SRPO alone\n22\t   - Kill criterion: stacking gain < 2% → claim 降级为\"complementary in principle\"\n23\t\n24\t## Story Spine\n25\t- **Problem**: Flow-matching VLAs 在标准 benchmark 上接近饱和(97-99%)，但 LIBERO-Plus 暴露了分布偏移下的灾难性鲁棒性缺口。现有方法分别解决检测(SAFE)、样本选择(ReconVLA)、训练时增强(RobustVLA/DiG-Flow/SRPO)，但没有方法在推理时利用结构化 uncertainty 信息主动校正动作。\n26\t- **Gap**: ReconVLA 用标量 Euclidean distance 做样本选择——丢弃跨维度协方差结构，且无法合成优于任何单个样本的动作。CP-in-the-Loop 通过 planning 闭环但非学习型参数化。UPS 用 CP 做策略门控但不将 conformal 特征作为校正网络输入。A2C2/PLD 学习残差但不利用 calibrated uncertainty features。\n27\t- **Our angle**: 第一个将多元 conformal 统计量作为学习型校正模块直接输入特征的方法。关键 insight 是 per-DOF conformal 特征编码\"哪些维度不确定+跨维度协方差\"，使 CRM 能做维度选择性校正。\n28\t- **Headline result template**: \"On LIBERO-Plus, ACR-VLA improves base VLA success by X%, and when stacked on SRPO (82.1%), achieves Y% — demonstrating that inference-time conformal correction provides orthogonal value beyond training-time optimization.\"\n29\t\n30\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n31\t1. **K=10 covariance 估计可靠性** (p/n=0.7): Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 是标准方案，MVP 已验证 K=10 estimated 仍有效（衰减 ~15pp 但仍显著）。若审稿人追问，可加 K=20 ablation。\n32\t2. **CRM 131K 参数表达力**: 故意轻量——防 overfitting + 保持推理速度。ablation 可测 dim 512 版本。\n33\t3. **Synthetic augmentation 覆盖不全** (layout/language 不可覆盖): Honest limitation。ACI 在线适应部分弥补。per-perturbation breakdown 是透明呈现。\n34\t4. **仿真 only**: CoRL 接受 sim-only，LIBERO-Plus 是 recognized benchmark。\n35\t5. **DiU 的 single-pass uncertainty 更高效**: DiU 捕获 aleatoric uncertainty（在分布内也高），CGS 捕获 epistemic uncertainty（分布偏移时升高）。A7 ablation 验证区分。\n36\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012B2TkzmyCHsDUgBWLtvzBj","session_id":"cb8be02c-35b7-47dd-bfab-cb2c629ce5a2","uuid":"6a01a435-3125-4ff6-a975-c87a48286783","timestamp":"2026-05-13T03:15:15.751Z"}
